---
layout: layouts/base.njk
home: true
permalink: /index.html
---
{% bookshelf %}

<hr class="asterism">

<p class="lede">
  This is a library rather than a blog: a small collection of entries,
  shelved by subject, cross-referenced, and corrected in place. Nothing here
  is finished and some of it is wrong. Every entry says how far along it is,
  from <a href="/notes/epistemic-status/">manuscript to bound</a>, and how
  much I currently believe it.
</p>
<p class="lede">
  Start anywhere. The <a href="/notes/">catalogue</a> lists everything, the
  <a href="/tags/">subjects</a> group it, the Explore panel shows the
  shelves, and the Graph View shows what cites what. Or
  <a href="#" data-search-open>search the stacks</a> — press <kbd>/</kbd>
  from any page.
</p>
<p class="lede">
  The figure turning behind the pages is the
  <a href="/notes/lorenz-attractor/">Lorenz attractor</a>: two states a hair
  apart that never meet again, yet never leave the same bounded shape. It is
  the house emblem, and the entry explains why.
</p>

<section class="home-section">
  <p class="section-label">Recently revised</p>
  <ul class="entry-list">
    {% for note in collections.notes | head(6) %}
    {% set st = site.stages[note.data.stage] or site.stages.manuscript %}
    <li class="entry">
      <div class="entry__head">
        <h2 class="entry__title"><a href="{{ note.url }}">{{ note.data.title }}</a></h2>
        <span class="entry__date">{{ (note.data.updated or note.date) | shortDate }}</span>
      </div>
      {% if note.data.summary %}<p class="entry__summary">{{ note.data.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
      <div class="entry__meta">
        <span class="stage stage--{{ st.label }}">{{ st.label }}</span>
        {% if note.data.shelf %}<span>{{ note.data.shelf }}</span>{% endif %}
        {% for tag in note.data.tags | head(3) %}<span>#{{ tag }}</span>{% endfor %}
      </div>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="home-section">
  <p class="section-label">Subjects</p>
  <div class="tag-cloud">
    {% for entry in collections.tagIndex %}
    <a class="tag" href="/tags/#{{ entry.tag }}">{{ entry.tag }}<span>{{ entry.count }}</span></a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
